# prometheus-bird-exporter service configuration
# This template configures the command-line arguments passed to the BIRD Prometheus Exporter.
# The exporter collects BGP/OSPF metrics from BIRD and exposes them to Prometheus.

# ARGS: Command-line arguments to pass to the prometheus-bird-exporter server.
# Due to shell escaping, to pass backslashes for regexes, you need to double them (\\d for \d).
# If running under systemd, you need to double them again (\\\\d to mean \d), and escape newlines too.
# Default is an empty string, meaning no extra arguments are passed.
ARGS="{{ args | default('') }}"